---
import { withBase } from '../utils/paths';
---

<section class="representative-events" aria-labelledby="representative-events-title">
  <header>
    <p>Signal examples</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="representative-events-title">What the classes look like</h2>
      <p>
        Ripple, IED, and ambiguous events can overlap in waveform shape and frequency content,
        particularly across subjects and recording channels.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <figure>
    <picture>
      <source
        srcset={withBase('media/neural-event-classification/02_representative_events.webp')}
        type="image/webp"
      />
      <img
        src={withBase('media/neural-event-classification/02_representative_events.svg')}
        alt="Three representative neural events shown as 300-millisecond multichannel waveforms and colored spectrograms: a ripple, an IED, and an ambiguous noise event."
        loading="lazy"
      />
    </picture>
    <figcaption>
      The 300 ms context reveals each event's surrounding morphology; the model uses the centered
      100 ms crop. Examples come from three different subjects. The ripple was chosen from a
      central-class shortlist for a clear, centered oscillatory burst; the IED is near its class center,
      and the ambiguous/noise example lies near the midpoint between the class centers. The
      spectrogram explains the signal, but the selected compact model does not use a spectrogram branch.
    </figcaption>
  </figure>
</section>

<style>
  .representative-events { margin: 0 0 46px; padding: 30px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .representative-events > header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 112px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }
  .representative-events > header > p {
    margin: 3px 0 0;
    color: var(--faint);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }
  .representative-events h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
  }
  .representative-events header div > p {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .representative-events figure { margin: 0; }
  .representative-events picture,
  .representative-events img { display: block; width: 100%; }
  .representative-events img { height: auto; background: #111210; }
  .representative-events figcaption {
    margin: 14px 0 0 140px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .representative-events > header { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .representative-events h2 { font-size: 19px; }
    .representative-events figcaption { margin-left: 0; }
  }
</style>
